    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38667" root="مضح" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَحَ عِرْضَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَحَ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْحٌ</span>; TA;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْضَحَهُ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِمْضَاحٌ</span>; TA;) <i>He disgraced,</i> or <i>dishonoured, him; blasted his reputation;</i> (El-Umawee, S, K;) <i>imputed to him,</i>
or <i>accused him of, a vice,</i> or <i>fault,</i> or <i>the like.</i>
(TA.)

